    "observations": [
      "Before: repeated row status; profile truncates long names, mobile sheet occupies bottom controls, 1024px profile scroll/focus moves it below the viewport.",
      "After: one-line ellipsis row with complete accessible name/title, attached presence mark and named groups; compact 16px title with complete wrapping identity in the card.",
      "Card bounds avoid header/composer/voice dock/mini-player. At 200% text or short page zoom, internal scroll is intentional; focus brings the DM action wholly inside the card. Header/close can scroll out at that position and are reached again by keyboard/scroll; Escape remains available. No claim that all profile content fits simultaneously.",
      "Empty and loading are distinct. Denied member hides identity/actions, with a themed 44px Retry target; retry restores the profile.",
      "Same existing member drawer; modal scrim darkens/inerts background as intended. The fixed desktop voice-drawer backdrop is asserted separately against full viewport bounds."
    ],
